    Situation_Text: `Situation: During a major peak-traffic product launch, a critical microservice fails, impacting 45,000 active users. An intense war room is convened on a video call. A senior director angrily demands: "Who merged this pull request without testing? I want the person responsible identified immediately!" You notice that the junior engineer who committed the code is trembling, completely silent, and looks overwhelmed.`,
